    <summary>Locks Windows folders in place and can encrypt their files with AES-256-GCM, a folder password protector that keeps data on shared PCs behind one password.</summary>
    <description>This package installs Folder Password Protector Software, a folder password protector for Windows 10 and 11. It closes folders with a password on the PC where it runs, relying on standard folder permissions and optional AES-256-GCM encryption. No kernel driver is added, and using it does not need administrator rights.

![Folder Password Protector screenshot 1](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/fpp/fpp-v5-folders.png)

## How to use it

1. Type the master password when the program opens.
2. Add a folder by drag and drop.
3. Pick Lock for quick access control, or Encrypt for files that must stay unreadable even outside Windows.
4. If you encrypt, store the recovery key on paper or in a file outside the folder.
5. Look at the status shown after the operation. The program verifies the result itself.

&gt; Trial note: the free trial never expires, but the unregistered version protects only one folder of up to 30 files. A license key removes this limit, and unlocking or decrypting is always allowed.

![Folder Password Protector screenshot 2](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/fpp/fpp-v5-locked.png)

## Lock and Encrypt

Lock is the default mode of this folder password protector. It leaves the files untouched and blocks access through deny rules that persist after a reboot. It is quick even on large folders. It does not help against a boot from external media or a permission change by the folder owner.

Encryption rewrites every file with AES-256-GCM. The key comes from your password via Argon2id, a file is replaced only after a complete write, and the password can be changed without encrypting again.

## Recovery and removal

The recovery key works on any PC, independent of the hardware it was created on and of any account or server, so a hardware change does not shut you out. Removing the program shows a warning while protected folders remain, and an emergency utility is included for that case.

![Folder Password Protector screenshot 3](https://download.softorbits.com/files/pkg-img/fpp/fpp-v5-encrypt.png)

## Who it is for

- Small offices where several people use the same workstation.
- Parents who want to password protect folder content on a family PC.
- Admins looking for a lock folder Windows tool that leaves no filter driver on managed PCs.

## Trial and license

The package installs the free trial of Folder Password Protector Software, a commercial program. Protecting more than one folder or more than 30 files needs a paid license: lifetime, 1-year, monthly or business. Plan details sit on the [password protect folder](https://www.softorbits.net/folder-password-protector/?utm_source=chocolatey&amp;utm_medium=package) page.

[Folder Password Protector Software on Windows Store](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N7Z1SPLQ78N)

## FAQ

### Is there any way to password protect a folder?

Yes, with a program like this one. It adds the password step that Windows lacks and lets you choose between a fast lock and full encryption.

### How do I lock a secure folder?

Select the folder in the program and choose Lock. The status check afterwards shows whether access is really blocked, and the folder can relock itself when the program closes or sits idle.

### How to password protect a secure folder?

For files that need more than an access lock, use Encrypt. Without the password or the recovery key the contents cannot be read, and the key is not linked to your hardware or to an account.
